  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器庫</a>添加以<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍族</a>為主題的新武器與特性。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>基於 cbkovak 為 1.12.2 版本開發的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-and-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達與火焰</a>模組。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/31541291/167636045-658a77d5-6af9-4af8-a819-03fd8ed41d5c.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"450\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支援材質：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>烈焰龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">冰龍傷害加成 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>-&nbsp;對冰龍造成 +8.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">烈焰 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 點燃並擊退敵人</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>冰霜龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">火龍傷害加成 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>-&nbsp;對火龍造成 +8.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">冰凍 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 冰凍敵人 10 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>閃電龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">冰龍傷害加成 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>-&nbsp;對冰龍造成 +4.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">火龍傷害加成 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>-&nbsp;對火龍造成 +4.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">電擊</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 以閃電打擊敵人</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沙漠蟻甲殼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>非節肢生物傷害加成 </strong></span>- 對非節肢生物與死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沙漠蟻刺</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>非節肢生物傷害加成 </strong></span>- 對非節肢生物與死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">中毒</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 使敵人中毒 10 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>叢林蟻甲殼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>非節肢生物傷害加成 </strong></span>- 對非節肢生物與死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>叢林蟻刺</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">非節肢生物傷害加成</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 對非節肢生物與死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">中毒</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 使敵人中毒 10 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>火焰龍鋼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">烈焰 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 點燃並擊退敵人</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>冰霜龍鋼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">冰凍 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 冰凍敵人 15 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>閃電龍鋼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>電擊&nbsp;</strong></span>- 以閃電打擊敵人</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>計劃更新：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將新功能回溯移植至 1.16.5 版本</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">回溯移植至 1.12.2 版本，以支援<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-rotn-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：RotN 版本</a>的閃電武器，並修復過程中的任何錯誤</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&amp;height=80&amp;n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
